      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Write a short, simple and natural business introduction email.\n\nStart with:\nHi [Lead Name],\n\nIntroduce me as Priyanka from Delta Mirai, a startup that provides AI-based business solutions.\n\nBriefly mention that Delta Mirai offers:\n- AI automation and AI agents\n- AI-powered dashboards and business insights\n- AI-generated marketing videos and content\n- Market research and lead generation\n\nKeep the services description short and easy to understand. Do not explain every service in detail.\n\nDo not make the email sound like an AI-generated sales pitch.\nDo not use complicated or corporate words.\nDo not mention the lead's company, purpose, or make assumptions about them.\nDo not mention ABC Ltd or XYZ Ltd.\nDo not use phrases like \"I came across\", \"I noticed\", \"I thought this might be relevant\", or \"I understand you're looking for\".\n\nEnd with:\n\"If you’re interested, we can schedule a short 20-minute call to discuss this further. You can simply reply to this email and I’ll get back to you.\"\n\nKeep the entire email around 80-100 words.\n\nSign off:\nBest regards,\nPriyanka\nDelta Mirai\n\nLead information:\n{{ $json.lead }}",
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "Read the lead information from the Google Docs data and write a short, professional personalized email.  Return only the email body."
